  "releaseNotes": "19.1.1\n* Spain: Facturae content rule validation (invoice/line/batch totals, NIF check digit, signature policy)\n* Spain: new ValidationOptions.CheckFACeRequirements plus matching Validate/ValidateAsync overloads for FACe reception checks\n* Italy: FatturaPA XSD updated to 1.2.3 (FPA12/FPR12), added \"fattura semplificata\" 1.0.2 (FSM10) support\n* Updated dependency to core library 19.1.1\n\n19.1.0\n* Local validation now uses KoSIT XRechnung Schematron 2.6.0 (BR-TMP-2 is now fatal)\n* Embedded invoice XML in PDFs without /Filter entry is now extracted correctly\n* Broken or unsupported PDF stream filters are reported as findings instead of exceptions\n* Fixed global variables in Schematron functions in the local validation engine",
